6273959794297, "start": 1778254967, "endText": "23:45", "stage": "awake", "startText": "23:42", "end": 1778255118}, {"widthPercent": 50.677886863020106, "startPercent": 49.322113136979894, "start": 1778255118, "endText": "00:03", "stage": "core", "startText": "23:45", "vitals": {"maxHeartRate": 55, "avgRespiratoryRate": 15, "avgHeartRate": 54.666666666666664, "minHeartRate": 54}, "end": 1778256202}], "date": "2026-05-08", "stages": {"core": 33, "unspecified": 0, "deep": 0, "awake": 3, "rem": 0}}], "generatedAt": 1778311935}, "toolCallID": "call_jhr6siwzsz83bf9p4bayehow", "updatedAt": "2026-05-09T07:32:15.386Z", "kind": "sleepVisualization", "anchor": {"value": "call_jhr6siwzsz83bf9p4bayehow", "type": "toolCall"}, "id": "15FC0E56-C6CD-4730-B62C-C22D127BD80C"}, {"kind": "text", "id": "14590FB4-65F9-4953-B56E-7D2A09558E15", "createdAt": "2026-05-09T07:32:39.463Z", "text": "你昨天（5月8日）的睡眠总时长仅35分钟，其中有效睡眠（核心睡眠）33分钟，清醒占比8.4%，没有深度和REM睡眠，属于严重睡眠不足哦。\n\n建议你今天适当调整作息，尽量在23点前准备入睡，避免睡前使用电子设备，若持续出现短睡眠情况，建议排查是否有睡眠节律紊乱或其他影响睡眠的因素~", "updatedAt": "2026-05-09T07:32:42.849Z"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "206170c4-0895-49e7-86a2-12c0893156f5", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "9f8ac741-d784-4f19-ad53-cebf3466c8b2", "server_message_id": "e89f9ecf-aedc-4a85-a631-5023f38068ef", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-09T14:20:45.375000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-11T01:54:31.269244+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"updatedAt": "2026-05-09T14:20:51.028Z", "text": "你好！我是你的专属健康助手 Spark，不管是运动、饮食、睡眠、健康管理相关的疑问，还是日程规划、知识查询等需求，都可以随时和我说哦~", "createdAt": "2026-05-09T14:20:49.698Z", "id": "652030BA-66B6-461F-9B24-B721F0706E4E", "kind": "text"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "b36509e8-8bd0-490f-92ab-cb9d4bf14083", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "0cb4eb1a-4d79-4be4-8da2-3d7da9cbace1", "server_message_id": "7d8e5d3a-1d10-4ee5-8e31-ed99f5738ab3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-11T01:54:30.908000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-11T01:54:31.274762+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"kind": "deepThought", "id": "9B9A6B4C-DE5D-40AD-A7C5-837534A1E62D", "deepThoughtCard": {"reasoningContent": "用户问最近三天睡眠情况，首先我拿到的工具返回只有5月10号的数据？不对哦，哦不对，用户说最近三天，是5月9、10、11对吧，现在工具只返回了5月10号的？不对哦不对，看一下当前日期是2026-05-11，今天的睡眠数据可能还没生成？因为一般睡眠是前一天晚上的，哦对，5月11号的睡眠要到今晚睡了才会有，5月9号的呢？哦可能用户5月9号没记录？不对先整理现有数据哦。首先说近三天的睡眠数据仅查询到5月10日的有效记录对吧？然后先报5月10日的情况：总睡眠时长5小时51分钟，比成人推荐的7-9小时短不少。然后各阶段占比：REM占35%（推荐20-25%，偏高），深度睡眠仅占15.9%（推荐15-25%，刚好卡下限但总量只有56分钟偏少），核心睡眠占50%。然后给建议：1. 建议尽量固定入睡时间在23点前，延长整体睡眠时长；2. 睡前1小时避免刷手机、喝提神饮品，有助于提升深度睡眠占比；3. 如果后续持续睡眠时长不足6小时，可以尝试午间补休15-20分钟缓解疲劳。对吧？哦对，还要说明5月9日和5月11日暂时没有有效睡眠记录，可能是未佩戴设备或者睡眠时长过短未被识别？对，要提到这点。", "reasoningDurationMs": 9845, "reasoningExpanded": false, "reasoningVisibility": "full"}, "createdAt": "2026-05-11T01:54:30.908Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-11T01:54:30.908Z"}, {"toolCallID": "call_fh38muwvbbujj8l9m435etq8", "anchor": {"value": "call_fh38muwvbbujj8l9m435etq8", "type": "toolCall"}, "sleepVisualization": {"generatedAt": 1778464446, "schemaVersion": "health_sleep_v1", "days": [{"timeline": [{"stage": "core", "start": 1778434022, "widthPercent": 5.84975369458128, "end": 1778435257, "endText": "01:47", "startPercent": 0, "startText": "01:27", "vitals": {"avgHeartRate": 59.2, "maxHeartRate": 60, "avgRespiratoryRate": 15.25, "minHeartRate": 59}}, {"stage": "deep", "start": 1778435257, "widthPercent": 9.55854490337249, "end": 1778437275, "endText": "02:21", "startPercent": 5.84975369458128, "startText": "01:47", "vitals": {"avgHeartRate": 61.875, "maxHeartRate": 63, "avgRespiratoryRate": 14.875, "minHeartRate": 60}}, {"stage": "rem", "start": 1778437275, "widthPercent": 3.708791208791209, "end":